                    {
                        "form_id": "70f79838-c967-462e-b697-6b7d0439943d",
                        "entry_id": "c9ecaeba-4c94-3f01-8171-7c9c68da851a",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "бедо́вее"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "4a7285e0-38a3-4ff4-a904-018c8e89a459",
                        "entry_id": "c9ecaeba-4c94-3f01-8171-7c9c68da851a",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "бедо́вей"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8f1ba7f0-ebc0-32ed-9b7a-321c4a4bfaf8",
                        "entry_id": "c9ecaeba-4c94-3f01-8171-7c9c68da851a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "разг. бесстрашный, отчаянный, озорной, горячий, рисковый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "935640b9-b540-4715-aede-31053e2063b7",
                                "sense_id": "8f1ba7f0-ebc0-32ed-9b7a-321c4a4bfaf8",
                                "text": "Буен во хмелю-то. Бедовый! Чуть что не по нем, только держись."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "926da03f-3dec-40a1-85c8-e3649eb2912d",
                                "sense_id": "8f1ba7f0-ebc0-32ed-9b7a-321c4a4bfaf8",
                                "text": "— Я, — говорит, — не полагал, что ты с дамами такой бедовый."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5fe61872-1031-458d-af3d-d1c830a0f4ca",
                                "sense_id": "8f1ba7f0-ebc0-32ed-9b7a-321c4a4bfaf8",
                                "text": "— Экой горячий! Бедовый!. Рыжие и все такие-то!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c34104cf-67a8-46da-b65a-4a8651e6b192",
                                "sense_id": "8f1ba7f0-ebc0-32ed-9b7a-321c4a4bfaf8",
                                "text": "Бедовое дело, сударь, истинно бедовое, — чума, сударь!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8af24abf-2ea7-47a0-900d-0f7f584a560f",
                                "sense_id": "8f1ba7f0-ebc0-32ed-9b7a-321c4a4bfaf8",
                                "text": "Сбитень московский, сахарный, медовый, на скус бедовый, с перцем, с сердцем, с нашим удовольствием!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3df4fd45-3835-3cf5-bc6d-484f52c955a4",
                        "entry_id": "c9ecaeba-4c94-3f01-8171-7c9c68da851a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "выражающий бесстрашие, отвагу, озорство"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "93157b94-d20a-466c-8ecf-2a7b90e3cad1",
                                "sense_id": "3df4fd45-3835-3cf5-bc6d-484f52c955a4",
                                "text": "Лицо у него было бурое, иссечённое, даже как будто не морщинами, а шрамами, и только глаза так и остались весёлыми, бедовыми, совсем молодыми."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "047e6c53-0b82-40bf-b5bf-0c03ce0651dd",
                        "source_entry_id": "c9ecaeba-4c94-3f01-8171-7c9c68da851a",
                        "target_lang_word": "dangerous",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dangerous",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce3d5c1a-5fc4-3c0d-8c30-0fe1ea47a67d",
                                        "entry_id": "577f2fa8-bf06-35b5-a22d-2b36cca98693",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Full of danger."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "98c8c7c3-3fa6-4f71-9b92-bdc16e9c7266",
                                                "sense_id": "ce3d5c1a-5fc4-3c0d-8c30-0fe1ea47a67d",
                                                "text": "Railway crossings without gates are highly dangerous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "392d18b0-1beb-403b-b886-2c7f36d12306",
                                                "sense_id": "ce3d5c1a-5fc4-3c0d-8c30-0fe1ea47a67d",
                                                "text": "[I]t is not fair of you to bring against mankind double weapons! Dangerous enough you are as woman alone, without bringing to your aid those gifts of mind suited to problems which men have been accustomed to arrogate to themselves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1e86b9ac-3447-4bcb-b446-ff3115ecadb3",
                                                "sense_id": "ce3d5c1a-5fc4-3c0d-8c30-0fe1ea47a67d",
                                                "text": "Young Indians looking for work opportunities have made up a sizeable portion of undocumented migrants in the US, many after making the dangerous trek through Latin America to reach the US southern border."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "595ec23e-5055-332d-95b8-fff32a3c5eba",
                                        "entry_id": "577f2fa8-bf06-35b5-a22d-2b36cca98693",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing danger; ready to do harm or injury."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9dc512ab-d1a1-4b9d-bc7d-1372aa9ef2c4",
                                                "sense_id": "595ec23e-5055-332d-95b8-fff32a3c5eba",
                                                "text": "If they incline to think you dangerous, / They have their knaviſh Arts to make you ſo."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f01577a2-175e-43e3-a146-27f5bf1397c1",
                                                "sense_id": "595ec23e-5055-332d-95b8-fff32a3c5eba",
                                                "text": "And the Duke thought: The truth could he worse than he imagines, but even dangerous facts are valuable if you’ve been trained to deal with them. And there’s one place where nothing has been spared for my son—dealing with dangerous facts."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3392884c-08be-3356-bb5a-a7013706bd27",
                                        "entry_id": "577f2fa8-bf06-35b5-a22d-2b36cca98693",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a condition of danger, as from illness; threatened with death."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial",
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "75e39048-889d-4617-ab33-f10f599fa1bd",
                        "source_entry_id": "c9ecaeba-4c94-3f01-8171-7c9c68da851a",
                        "target_lang_word": "risky",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "risky",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ab6f8f22-98b0-34c7-89d0-22715dc8893e",
                                        "entry_id": "af27dfc8-1360-3b1a-ab47-4388674fe78d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Dangerous, involving risks."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fc772f87-1f6e-4912-9f66-4384f1650c13",
                                                "sense_id": "ab6f8f22-98b0-34c7-89d0-22715dc8893e",
                                                "text": "Investing in this start-up company could be risky."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c61b31d8-3c9f-4dd6-a6c4-a1a92eb90443",
                                                "sense_id": "ab6f8f22-98b0-34c7-89d0-22715dc8893e",
                                                "text": "Jumping on the train from the bridge to catch the terrorist was a highly risky operation."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8420fb0d-2d69-3e54-afc1-89afab7bad3b",
                                        "entry_id": "af27dfc8-1360-3b1a-ab47-4388674fe78d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Misspelling of risqué."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "misspelling"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45cfab75-1c7e-484f-8c53-45a99794506a",
                                                "sense_id": "8420fb0d-2d69-3e54-afc1-89afab7bad3b",
                                                "text": "Have you no risky songs, no indecent ballads?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "93eb6f1d-43e9-4ee4-94a5-00222b80496d",
                                                "sense_id": "8420fb0d-2d69-3e54-afc1-89afab7bad3b",
                                                "text": "That awkward moment when someone doesn't reply to your risky text message."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3ad66c0-7e50-4f04-a163-7999cc0746a4",
                                                "sense_id": "8420fb0d-2d69-3e54-afc1-89afab7bad3b",
                                                "text": "Ronald Frankau (pronounced Franco) wrote a few risky songs, such as FANNY'S BEEN EVACUATED NOW with the line “and for half a pound of butter, well a lady's got to eat” ~ he got banned for it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
